This PR updates the `MimiIWG` version to 1.2, and enforces that as the lowest bound via the `compat` section of the `Project.toml`. This change was made so that the version of `MimiIWG` being used does not depend on the `ExcelReaders` package as explained in the partner PR here: https://github.com/rffscghg/MimiIWG.jl/pull/56 

In addition, I ran a general `up` on the environment to try to clean up some warnings coming from the Julia base package `StatsFun`, which bumped some versions of minor packages, and most notably did bump `Mimi` from `1.3.8` to `1.4`. Upon inspection of `Mimi` this will not alter any behavior but could improve speed. I acknowledge calling `up` on projects should be done very carefully, and if you'd rather me stick to only updating `MimiIWG` and leaving all other versions alone that is fine too!

